  {
    "title": "Ech Green",
    "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ech%20Green&query_place_id=ChIJG0Yc7IkE9YgRsymOdccxfi0",
    "stars": 5,
    "name": "Subhajit Bag",
    "reviewUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4WGIxaFVVR1JEZERGd1NFbERNR281VTBWdVlsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2d7e31c7758e29b3!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkxXb1hUUGRDdDFwSElDMGo5U0VuYlE%7C0cjoEpeWJT9%7C?hl=en",
    "text": "Tech Green is the heartbeat of Georgia Tech\u2019s campus\u2014a wide, beautiful stretch of green right in the middle of all the action. On any given day, you\u2019ll find students lounging with laptops, playing frisbee, hosting club events, or just soaking up the Atlanta sun between classes. It\u2019s the perfect balance of calm and energy\u2014you can relax here with a coffee, but five minutes later, you might get invited to join a pickup soccer game or watch a pop-up performance.\n\nThe view is gorgeous, with the surrounding modern campus buildings framing the lawn, and at night, the soft lighting makes it feel cozy and safe. During spring and fall, it\u2019s the spot for photos, picnics, or just people-watching. In the middle of a busy academic day, Tech Green is a reminder that college life is more than just lectures\u2014it\u2019s a community.\n\nWhether you\u2019re a student, alum, or just visiting campus, grab a snack from nearby food spots, find a sunny patch of grass, and enjoy one of the best gathering spaces Georgia Tech has to offer."
  },
